    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010About 2025 -TOBI-\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second in Kibodo's classic game series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a vertical scrolling shooting game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are left and right movement only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is over when the fighter runs out of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get items to replenish bullets and destroy the enemies in front of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Items\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfBullet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305210/extras/8749fbd5982f2bbb14ce3130237f78d9.avif?t=1737100808\" width=256 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfShield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305210/extras/1169f9f72ae448e131fab73fa60ed454.avif?t=1737100808\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfPower-Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305210/extras/6e6bf5919e75ff7ed0bf4e07f56cbfda.avif?t=1737100808\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\uff1f\uff1f\uff1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305210/extras/17ac14873226eb533c12ac4bf7538467.avif?t=1737100808\" width=256 height=128 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010About 2025 -TOBI-\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second in Kibodo's classic game series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a vertical scrolling shooting game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are left and right movement only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is over when the fighter runs out of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get items to replenish bullets and destroy the enemies in front of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Items\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfBullet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305210/extras/8749fbd5982f2bbb14ce3130237f78d9.avif?t=1737100808\" width=256 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfShield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305210/extras/1169f9f72ae448e131fab73fa60ed454.avif?t=1737100808\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfPower-Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305210/extras/6e6bf5919e75ff7ed0bf4e07f56cbfda.avif?t=1737100808\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\uff1f\uff1f\uff1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305210/extras/17ac14873226eb533c12ac4bf7538467.avif?t=1737100808\" width=256 height=128 /></span></p>",
